  data: {
    LLM: "Keep the Joker on the 'outside' of your hand fan to make it easier for the person to your left to pick it. Don't act too happy if you get rid of it!\n\nManipulation: Shuffle your hand every time someone is about to draw from you, but try to 'present' a specific card that isn't the Joker to trick them into taking the Joker instead.\n\nReverse Psychology: Most players pick cards from the middle of a hand. If you have 3 cards including the Joker, place the Joker in the traditional 'safe' spot (far left/right) and watch your opponent over-think themselves into taking it.",
    Player: "Keep the Joker on the 'outside' of your hand fan to make it easier for the person to your left to pick it. Don't act too happy if you get rid of it!\n\nManipulation: Shuffle your hand every time someone is about to draw from you, but try to 'present' a specific card that isn't the Joker to trick them into taking the Joker instead.\n\nReverse Psychology: Most players pick cards from the middle of a hand. If you have 3 cards including the Joker, place the Joker in the traditional 'safe' spot (far left/right) and watch your opponent over-think themselves into taking it.",
